Data attribution
----------------
Pincode district/state names are derived from the All India Pincode
Directory, Department of Posts, Government of India, published on the Open
Government Data Platform (https://www.data.gov.in) under the Government
Open Data License (GODL-India-1.0).

Pincode area centroid coordinates are obtained from OpenStreetMap via
Nominatim (https://nominatim.openstreetmap.org), (c) OpenStreetMap
contributors, available under the Open Database License (ODbL):
https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright

In accordance with the ODbL and the OSMF Attribution Guidelines, the app
displays visible credit linking to https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright
wherever approximate area distances derived from this data are shown.
Coordinates are reviewed against independent map sources before use; the
SQL seed records the per-pincode source and review outcome.
